Compatibility source branch for Ubuntu sip6 6.16.1-2.
Canonical packaging: https://salsa.debian.org/python-team/packages/sip6.git
Upstream: https://github.com/Python-SIP/sip

The additional quilt patch makes legacy stable-ABI requests fall back to the
active interpreter ABI on a free-threaded Python. Generated headers, composite
modules and compiler definitions agree. Requests for the newer stable ABI from
Python 3.15 onward retain their existing behavior. GIL safety declarations are
preserved. No package names or dependency-specific replacements are involved.

The regression is part of the existing pytest suite. SBI discovers this rolling
branch using its exact Debian source/version metadata, without a commit pin.
